[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 e5 2. Nc3 f6 {A weak move: it takes the best square from Black's knight and opens the diagonal to the king.} 3. Nge2 Nc6 4. d4 {Strike in the center.} Bb4 5. d5 {Gain space and push the knight away.} Nce7 6. a3 *

[Event "vs Owen's Defense 1...b6"]
[Opening "Other replies to 1.e4"]
[Side "White"]
[Result "*"]

1. e4 b6 {Owen's Defense: the bishop will attack e4 from b7.} 2. d4 {Take the whole center.} Bb7 3. Bd3 {Protect e4 with a piece that develops.} e6 4. Nf3 c5 5. c3 {Keep a strong pawn on d4.} Nf6 6. Qe2 {Protect e4 once more.} *
